# Keys, in case one is ever put down in here by hand.
#
# None is, and none should be: the App Store Connect key lives in
# ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys and the Android upload keystore outside the
# repo — both places the tools look by default. This is only so that a key
# dropped in here while working cannot be committed by a `git add -A`.
*.p8
*.keystore
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
